# Web Scraper – Job & Offers Automation (Python)

This project is a Python-based web scraper that extracts real-world data from multiple websites, filters relevant results, and exports them into structured formats.

## Features
- Web scraping using Requests, BeautifulSoup, and Selenium
- Extracts job offers and product data
- Filters best offers based on keywords
- Saves results to CSV and JSON
- Clean and modular project structure

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Requests
- BeautifulSoup
- Selenium
- CSV & JSON handling

